        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashland%2C_Oregon",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The railroad arrived in 1884, and by 1891 Ashland boasted a library, City Band, and Opera House.",
