      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Bear Creek Greenway starts near West Nevada and Helman Streets, following Ashland Creek through Lithia Park for hikers and bikers.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
